---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import ServicesGrid from '../components/ServicesGrid.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import GoogleBusinessInfo from '../components/GoogleBusinessInfo.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Drain & Sewer Cleaning in Mason City, Iowa | A-1 Drain Cleaning"
  description="Need a plumber in Mason City, Iowa for a clogged drain or sewer backup? A-1 Drain Cleaning handles drain and sewer cleaning across North Iowa."
  path="/"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <Hero />

    <section aria-label="A-1 Drain Cleaning services" class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white">
      <div class="container overflow-x-auto">
        <div class="grid min-w-[900px] grid-cols-5 divide-x divide-slate-200">
          <a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="group flex min-h-[150px] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center transition hover:bg-slate-50">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 text-[#1A1A68]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4">
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" />
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="17" />
              <path d="M23 24h2M31 20h2M40 24h2M20 32h2M30 29h2M40 32h2M24 40h2M33 40h2M39 40h2" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-black uppercase leading-5 tracking-wide text-[#1A1A68]">Main Drain<br />Cleaning</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="group flex min-h-[150px] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center transition hover:bg-slate-50">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 text-[#1A1A68]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M18 12v25c0 8 6 14 14 14s14-6 14-14V29" />
              <path d="M18 12h11M46 29h10" />
              <path d="M12 10h12v8H12zM46 25h12v8H46z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
            </svg>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-black uppercase leading-5 tracking-wide text-[#1A1A68]">Sewer Line<br />Cleaning</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="group flex min-h-[150px] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center transition hover:bg-slate-50">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 text-[#1A1A68]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <ellipse cx="32" cy="33" rx="23" ry="17" />
              <path d="M18 27l28 12M18 38l28-12M32 16v34M11 33h42" />
            </svg>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-black uppercase leading-5 tracking-wide text-[#1A1A68]">Floor Drain<br />Backups</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/services/toilet-clogs/" class="group flex min-h-[150px] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center transition hover:bg-slate-50">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 text-[#1A1A68]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 12h22v17c0 8-5 14-13 14s-13-6-13-14V12z" />
              <path d="M21 12h22M27 43v8M37 43v8M23 52h18" />
            </svg>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-black uppercase leading-5 tracking-wide text-[#1A1A68]">Toilet &amp; Drain<br />Clogs</span>
          </a>

          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="group flex min-h-[150px] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center transition hover:bg-slate-50">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 text-[#b4232b]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 12l8 8-6 7c4 8 8 12 14 14l7-6 8 8-5 8c-2 3-7 4-11 2C22 46 14 38 9 24c-2-5 0-9 4-11l8-1z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-black uppercase leading-5 tracking-wide text-[#b4232b]">Call<br />641-530-2728</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ServicesGrid />

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Equipment & methods</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">The right tool depends on the line.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h3 class="font-black">Drain machines</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Different cable sizes and root-cutting equipment help clear drain and sewer blockages when suited to the line and the problem.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h3 class="font-black">Sewer cameras</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">A camera can show what is inside a sewer line when a recurring problem needs more investigation.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h3 class="font-black">Line locating</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Locating equipment can help identify where an underground sewer or drain line runs.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h3 class="font-black">Hydro-jetting</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Pressurized water can clean buildup when jetting is appropriate for the pipe and blockage.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">North Iowa</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Mason City and North Iowa</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City, Iowa and serves Mason City and surrounding North Iowa communities for drain cleaning and sewer work.</p>
        <a href="/service-area/" class="mt-7 inline-block font-black text-[#b4232b]">See the full service area →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="homepage-faq-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain cleaning questions</p>
        <h2 id="homepage-faq-heading" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Frequently asked questions about drain and sewer problems</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">These are common signs homeowners notice before calling A-1 Drain Cleaning in Mason City and across North Iowa.</p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">Why is sewage or dirty water coming up through my basement floor drain?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A blockage in a shared drain or main sewer line can make wastewater come back through the lowest opening, often a basement floor drain. Stop running water in the house as much as possible and call A-1 Drain Cleaning at 641-530-2728.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">Why does my floor drain back up when the washing machine drains?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A washing machine sends a large volume of water into the drain in a short time. If the line downstream is restricted, the water may spill from a standpipe or floor drain. Avoid running another wash until the drain problem is checked.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">What if my house has no basement and the main sewer line is blocked?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">In a slab or no-basement house, wastewater from a blocked main line may back up into a bathtub or shower instead of a basement floor drain. Stop using water where possible and call to describe which fixtures are affected.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">How can I tell whether the clog is in one drain or the main line?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">If one sink or tub is slow, the restriction may be near that fixture. If several fixtures act up together, or using one fixture makes another drain back up, the problem may be farther down a shared branch or main drain line.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">Can tree roots cause a sewer line to keep clogging?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Roots can enter sewer lines through joints or damaged sections and catch waste, leading to repeated blockages. Clearing the line may restore flow; a recurring problem may need further inspection to understand the pipe's condition.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">Does A-1 Drain Cleaning serve towns outside Mason City?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. A-1 Drain Cleaning serves Mason City and surrounding North Iowa communities. Visit the <a href="/service-area/" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">service-area page</a> for the current town list, or call 641-530-2728 to ask about your address.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">What should I do while a sewer backup is happening?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Stop using toilets, sinks, showers, and the washing machine as much as possible. Keep children and pets away from wastewater, and avoid chemical drain cleaners when the line is backed up. Call A-1 Drain Cleaning for help.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="group border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none pr-8 text-lg font-black text-slate-950 marker:hidden">Does A-1 Drain Cleaning handle more than floor drain backups?<span class="float-right ml-3 text-[#b4232b]" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. Services include main drain cleaning, sewer-line cleaning, clogged sinks and tubs, toilet and laundry drains, tree-root blockages, hydro-jetting, storm sewers, and sewer smoke testing.</p>
          </details>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-7 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Still have a drain problem? Call A-1 Drain Cleaning: <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA showForm />
    <GoogleBusinessInfo />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
